  "note": "Founder request 1405/08/05 (2026-10-27) after the case-assistant QA (three simulated-user agents, ~50 cases through the real pipeline): «همه رو اصلاح کن». 1) Persian/English twins and spelling duplicates merged (#ونیر into #ونیر_سرامیکی here; that one into #لمینیت_سرامیکی in A106, since a rename is one hop) into one concept each; every retired form and all its aliases move onto the survivor, so no door closes (the twins existed only as separate lexical doors). 2) #فقدان_دندان merged into #جایگزینی_دندان (same definition: a missing tooth and the replacement question, sometimes answered «no»); #جایگزینی_دندان added to the RBFDP/bridge/anterior-implant/free-end decision pages that answer that question. #فضای_بی_دندان kept: its one page is about visual perception, not replacement. 3) #اسپلینت kept for occlusal splints only (its definition); splinted teeth/implants pages moved to #اسپلینت_پروتزی / #اسپلینت_ایمپلنت. 4) #ایمپلنت_قدامی removed from the two AI-mockup pages (insight-89, share-25), which are not about anterior implants. 5) Colloquial spellings added; «دست دندان» moved from #دندان_مصنوعی (denture teeth) to #پروتز_متحرک (a denture). Kept apart on purpose: #VD/#VDO (bare-acronym aliases would rewrite #افزایش_VD/#کاهش_VDO into an alias cycle), #اندو (a bare «اندو» alias would rewrite #تست_اندو, a pulp-vitality test), and by definition retention vs resistance form, #روکش vs #روکش_دندان, #بارگذاری_ایمپلنت vs #زمان_لود_ایمپلنت, #مدل_زبانی_بزرگ (diagnostic LLM) vs #مدل_زبانی.",
